2.
Definitions.
- In these Rules, unless the context otherwise requires -
(a)
"Act" means the Greater Hyderabad Municipal Corporation Act, 1955;
(b)
"Corporation" means a municipal corporation constituted under the Act;
(c)
"Form" means the form appended to these rules;
(d)
"Government" means the Government of Andhra Pradesh;
(e)
"Member" means a member of the Municipal Corporation;
(f)
Words used but not defined in the rules shall have the meaning assigned to them in the Act.
